Hi contributors,

We've migrated the CI pipeline from GitHub Actions to Woodpecker CI.
Key changes:

- Build matrix: Go 1.22, 1.23 on Linux amd64 and arm64
- Lint step now runs golangci-lint with the config in .golangci.yml
- Race detector enabled for all test runs
- Coverage reports uploaded to the wiki automatically
- Build artifacts (Linux, macOS, Windows) published as release assets

The old GitHub Actions workflows have been removed. If your fork
still references them, delete .github/workflows/ and pull the new
.woodpecker/ directory.

Thanks,
The Bongo Infrastructure Team

